REM ====================================================================
REM  CONFIG.SYS (template) for a CastaliaOS 98 PE / FreeDOS boot.
REM
REM  Minimal and repairable. The installer backs up your existing
REM  CONFIG.SYS (CONFIG.CB_) before adding anything. CastaliaOS itself only
REM  needs conventional DOS services plus a DPMI host (the DOS/4GW extender
REM  ships with the shell). HIMEM/upper-memory lines below are optional but
REM  recommended for a healthy 128 MB machine.
REM
REM  Safe recovery: if the machine will not boot, press F5 to skip CONFIG.SYS
REM  and AUTOEXEC.BAT entirely, or F8 to step through lines. See RECOVERY.md.
REM ====================================================================

DEVICE=C:\FDOS\BIN\HIMEMX.EXE
DOS=HIGH,UMB
FILES=40
BUFFERS=20
LASTDRIVE=Z

REM No sound, network, or USB driver is required to reach the desktop.
